# NEAR HACKATHON work (2026-11-14). See near-hackathon/PROVENANCE.md.
menu "BitPOS product"
config BITPOS_PRODUCT_NEAR
    bool "BitPOS Mini · NEAR product (bitpos_terminal_near)"
    default n
    help
        Server-driven screens over HTTPS for bills on NEAR. The device reads the bill from a NEAR RPC node itself
        and signs an Ed25519 witness message; the standard ordering WebSocket and Solana payment scenes are not
        started. Build with BITPOS_PRODUCT=near (sdkconfig.near), see tools/firmware/build-near.sh.
endmenu
